1
00:00:00,658 --> 00:00:01,678
(Leonard:)All right.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:08,460
(Howard:)Sheldon, when this whole thing
with the parking space started...

3
00:00:08,666 --> 00:00:12,796
(Howard:)...I had no idea
just how much of a crazy bastard...

4
00:00:13,004 --> 00:00:16,274
(Raj:)Howard, that's not how we practiced it.

5
00:00:17,508 --> 00:00:20,638
(Howard:)I had no idea
how much that spot meant to you.

6
00:00:20,845 --> 00:00:23,405
Anyway, I called President Seibert...

7
00:00:23,648 --> 00:00:27,518
(Howard:)...and told him
it's not worth fighting over the spot...

8
00:00:27,719 --> 00:00:29,419
(Howard:)...so you keep it...

9
00:00:29,654 --> 00:00:32,684
(Howard:)...and I'll park in the structure
across the street.

10
00:00:33,992 --> 00:00:35,922
(Sheldon:)Well, Howard, thank you.

11
00:00:37,362 --> 00:00:40,092
That's quite a gesture on your part.

12
00:00:40,398 --> 00:00:42,828
(Sheldon:)You've shown yourself
to be the bigger man.

13
00:00:43,034 --> 00:00:46,064
(Sheldon:)- Thank you.
- Which I find totally unacceptable.

14
00:00:46,938 --> 00:00:48,408
(Sheldon:)I must be the bigger man.

15
00:00:49,941 --> 00:00:53,001
(Sheldon:)Therefore, you may use my spot...

16
00:00:53,211 --> 00:00:59,021
(Sheldon:)...until such time as I learn to drive
or get a Batmobile.

